<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb">
<title>Apex فون | أفضل أسعار الهواتف المحمولة في سوريا 2026</title>
<meta name="description" content="Apex فون - وجهتك الأولى لشراء الهواتف الذكية الأصلية في سوريا.">

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Almarai:wght@400;700;800&family=Tajawal:wght@700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.css" />
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js"></script>

<script>tailwind.config = { theme: { extend: { fontFamily: { sans: ['Almarai', 'sans-serif'] }, colors: { brand: { 500: '#2563eb', 600: '#1d4ed8', 900: '#1e3a8a' }, gold: { 500: '#d4af37' } } } } }</script>
<style>
  html, body { max-width: 100vw; overflow-x: hidden; background: #f8fafc; }
  .hide-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 4px; }
  .hide-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #e2e8f0; border-radius: 10px; }
  .hide-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
  .glow-green { box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); }
  .glow-gray { box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3); }
  .phone-card { transition: all 0.3s ease; }
  .phone-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
  .featured-card { border: 2px solid #d4af37 !important; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3) !important; }
  
  #preloader { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9999; background: #080b14; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: opacity 1.5s ease-in-out, visibility 1.5s ease-in-out; }
  #preloader.hidden { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; }
  .premium-title { font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif; font-size: 52px; font-weight: 900; color: #f8fafc; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); }
  .royal-loader-container { position: relative; width: 140px; height: 140px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .ring-outer { position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; border-top-color: #d4af37; border-bottom-color: #d4af37; animation: spin-slow 3s linear infinite; }
  .ring-inner { position: absolute; inset: 15px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; border-left-color: #3b82f6; border-right-color: #3b82f6; animation: spin-fast 1.5s linear infinite reverse; }
  .loader-phone-icon { font-size: 40px; color: #d4af37; }
  @keyframes spin-slow { 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  @keyframes spin-fast { 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .loader-text-modern { font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 1px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .loading-dots::after { content: ''; animation: dots 1.5s steps(4, end) infinite; color: #d4af37; font-weight: 900; }
  @keyframes dots { 0%, 20% { content: ''; } 40% { content: '.'; } 60% { content: '..'; } 80%, 100% { content: '...'; } }
  .modal-overlay { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); }
  .royal-modal-wrap { position: relative; border-radius: 24px; padding: 3px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); display: flex; width: 100%; max-width: 420px; }
  .royal-modal-wrap::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%; background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0 340deg, #ffffff 360deg); animation: rotateBorder 3s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes rotateBorder { 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .royal-modal-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #111827 100%); border-radius: 21px; padding: 1.5rem; width: 100%; }
  .gold-glow { text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.8); }
  .text-gold-500 { color: #d4af37; }
  .from-gold-500 { --tw-gradient-from: #d4af37; }
  .to-yellow-600 { --tw-gradient-to: #ca8a04; }
  .to-yellow-700 { --tw-gradient-to: #a16207; }
</style>
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased selection:bg-brand-500 selection:text-white flex flex-col min-h-screen">

<div id="preloader">
  <div class="premium-title">Apex فون</div>
  <div class="royal-loader-container"><div class="ring-outer"></div><div class="ring-inner"></div><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button loader-phone-icon"></i></div>
  <div class="loader-text-modern">يتم تحميل كامل البيانات<span class="loading-dots"></span></div>
</div>

<!-- نافذة الإشعارات الأنيقة -->
<div id="notifModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100000] bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm hidden items-center justify-center p-4">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden shadow-2xl transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300" id="notifContent">
    <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-4 flex justify-between items-center">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell text-gold-500"></i> الإشعارات</h3>
      <button onclick="closeNotifModal()" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/20 transition"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button>
    </div>
    <div id="notifList" class="p-4 max-h-[60vh] overflow-y-auto space-y-3">
      <!-- سيتم ملء الإشعارات هنا -->
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="fraudModal" class="modal-overlay fixed top-0 left-0 w-screen h-screen z-[10000] hidden items-center justify-center p-4">
  <div id="modalContent" class="royal-modal-wrap opacity-0 translate-y-4 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="royal-modal-inner text-center">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-gold-500 to-yellow-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white text-2xl shadow-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown"></i></div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3 gold-glow">تنبيه سيادي هام</h3>
      <div class="bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 mb-5 text-right"><p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><span class="text-red-400 block mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation mr-1"></i> <b>نظراً لانتشار عمليات الاحتيال (الرعبون):</b></span> يمنع منعاً باتاً تحويل أي مبالغ (عربون) عبر الهرم أو شام كاش <span class="text-red-400 underline decoration-1">إلا بعد موافقة صريحة من قسم الإدارة حصراً</span>.<br><span class="text-slate-400 text-[9px]">الإدارة تخلي مسؤوليتها عن أي تحويل يتم دون علمها.</span></p></div>
      <div class="space-y-2 relative z-10">
        <button onclick="closeFraudModal(); playFirstModalSounds();" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-500 to-yellow-600 hover:from-yellow-400 hover:to-yellow-500 text-black py-2.5 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-base transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check-double"></i> أوافق وأتفهم</button>
        <a href="/policy" onclick="playFirstModalSounds();" class="block w-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-300 border border-white/10 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs transition">قراءة سياسة الضمان</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="servicesModal" class="modal-overlay fixed top-0 left-0 w-screen h-screen z-[10000] hidden items-center justify-center p-4">
  <div id="servicesContent" class="royal-modal-wrap opacity-0 translate-y-4 transition-all duration-300">
    <div class="royal-modal-inner text-center">
      <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-purple-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-white text-2xl shadow-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i></div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2 gold-glow">خدمات حصرية</h3>
      <div class="bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-xl p-3 mb-5"><p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">نوفر شحن جميع الألعاب والبرامج، وحسابات <span class="text-brand-400 font-extrabold">App Store</span> الأصلية بأسعار لا تُنافس.</p></div>
      <div class="space-y-2 relative z-10">
        <a href="https://wa.me/963980259127" target="_blank" onclick="playSecondModalSounds();" class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-600 text-white py-2.5 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-base transition-all shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-xl"></i> تواصل مع الإدارة</a>
        <button onclick="playSecondModalSounds(); closeServicesModal();" class="w-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-slate-300 border border-white/10 py-2 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs transition">تصفح المتجر</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<main class="flex-1 flex flex-col w-full">
  <nav class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-sm w-full">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 h-12 flex justify-between items-center">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><div class="w-7 h-7 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-600 to-brand-900 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen text-white text-xs"></i></div><span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900">Apex <span class="text-brand-600">فون</span></span></a>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <div id="notifBell" class="relative cursor-pointer" onclick="showNotifications()">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 transition"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell text-sm"></i></div>
          <span id="notifCount" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-red-500 text-white text-[9px] font-bold px-1.5 rounded-full border-2 border-white hidden">0</span>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/963980259127" target="_blank" class="bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full font-bold transition shadow-sm flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px]"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> تواصل</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="bg-gradient-to-l from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-5 px-3 text-center border-b-2 border-brand-600 w-full">
    <h1 class="text-base md:text-lg font-extrabold mb-1">أفخم الهواتف بين يديك</h1>
    <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-300 max-w-xs mx-auto mb-3">تصفح أحدث الأجهزة الأصلية بضمان محلي.</p>
    <form action="/" method="GET" class="max-w-xs mx-auto relative mb-2">
      <input type="text" name="search" value="<%= search %>" placeholder="ابحث عن هاتف..." class="w-full px-3 py-2 pr-9 rounded-lg text-slate-900 font-bold outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/50 transition text-xs">
      <button type="submit" class="absolute right-1 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-6 h-6 bg-brand-600 text-white rounded flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-brand-700 transition text-[10px]"><i class="fa-solid fa-search"></i></button>
    </form>
    <a href="/post-ad" class="block bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-600 text-white text-center py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-[10px] shadow-sm hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-500 transition max-w-xs mx-auto mb-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus-circle mr-1"></i> بِع جهازك الآن (أضف إعلانك)</a>
    <a href="/verify-account" class="block bg-slate-800 text-white text-center py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-[10px] shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-700 transition max-w-xs mx-auto"><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card mr-1 text-blue-400"></i> وثّق حسابك (احصل على علامة ✔️)</a>
    <a href="/games" onclick="redirectToGames(event); return false;" class="block bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-600 to-purple-600 text-white text-center py-1.5 rounded-lg font-bold text-[10px] shadow-sm hover:from-fuchsia-500 hover:to-purple-500 transition max-w-xs mx-auto mt-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad mr-1"></i> شحن الألعاب الآن</a>
  </div>

  <% if (banners && banners.length > 0) { %>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 pt-3 w-full">
    <div class="swiper banner-swiper shadow-md">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper"><% banners.forEach(b => { %><div class="swiper-slide"><img src="https://images.weserv.nl/?url=https://apexphonesyria.online<%= b.image_url %>&w=800&output=webp&q=80" alt="Banner"></div><% }) %></div>
      <div class="swiper-pagination"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 pt-3 w-full flex justify-between items-center">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 overflow-x-auto hide-scroll pb-1 w-full max-w-[80%]">
      <a href="/" class="flex-shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold transition border <%= !activeBrand ? 'bg-brand-600 text-white border-brand-600' : 'bg-white text-slate-600 border-slate-200 hover:border-brand-500' %>">الكل</a>
      <% brands.forEach(b => { %><a href="/?brand=<%= encodeURIComponent(b) %><%= search ? '&search=' + encodeURIComponent(search) : '' %><%= currentSort ? '&sort=' + currentSort : '' %>" class="flex-shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold transition border <%= activeBrand === b ? 'bg-brand-600 text-white border-brand-600' : 'bg-white text-slate-600 border-slate-200 hover:border-brand-500' %>"><%= b %></a><% }) %>
    </div>
    <form action="/" method="GET" class="flex-shrink-0">
      <% if(search) { %><input type="hidden" name="search" value="<%= search %>"><% } %><% if(activeBrand) { %><input type="hidden" name="brand" value="<%= activeBrand %>"><% } %>
      <select name="sort" onchange="this.form.submit()" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-lg px-2 py-1 outline-none cursor-pointer">
        <option value="default" <%= currentSort === 'default' ? 'selected' : '' %>>الافتراضي</option><option value="newest" <%= currentSort === 'newest' ? 'selected' : '' %>>الأحدث</option><option value="price_asc" <%= currentSort === 'price_asc' ? 'selected' : '' %>>الأرخص</option><option value="price_desc" <%= currentSort === 'price_desc' ? 'selected' : '' %>>الأغلى</option>
      </select>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 py-4 w-full">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3"><h2 class="text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire text-orange-500"></i> <%= search ? 'البحث عن: ' + search : 'الأجهزة المتوفرة' %></h2></div>
    <% if (phones.length === 0) { %><div class="text-center py-8 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen text-2xl text-slate-200 mb-1"></i><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold">لا توجد أجهزة.</p></div><% } else { %>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 md:gap-4 w-full">
        <% phones.forEach(p => { let imgs = []; try { imgs = JSON.parse(p.images || '[]'); } catch(e) {} if (imgs.length === 0) imgs = ['https://via.placeholder.com/400x400?text=No+Image']; const isAvailable = (p.availability || 'متوفر') === 'متوفر'; const isSold = p.availability === 'تم البيع'; const isFeatured = p.is_featured === 1; %>
          <div class="phone-card w-full bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-2 flex flex-col relative <%= isFeatured ? 'featured-card' : '' %>">
            <% if(isFeatured) { %><div class="absolute -top-2 -right-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-500 to-yellow-600 text-white text-[8px] font-extrabold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-lg z-10 animate-pulse"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i> مميز</div><% } %>
            <a href="/phone/<%= p.id %>" class="block w-full h-[110px] bg-slate-50 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-2 relative group">
              <img src="https://images.weserv.nl/?url=https://apexphonesyria.online<%= imgs[0] %>&w=400&output=webp&q=80" alt="<%= p.name %>" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-contain p-1 group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500 <%= isSold ? 'grayscale opacity-50' : '' %>">
              <div class="absolute top-1 right-1 flex flex-col gap-1 items-end">
                <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur text-brand-600 text-[8px] font-extrabold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm"><%= p.brand %></div>
                <% if (p.is_admin === 1) { %><div class="bg-blue-600 text-white text-[7px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-0.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> الإدارة</div><% } else if (p.seller_phone && verifiedPhones.includes(p.seller_phone)) { %><div class="bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 border border-blue-200 text-[7px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm flex items-center gap-0.5">
    <svg class="w-2.5 h-2.5 inline-block" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M22.25 12c0-1.43-.88-2.67-2.19-3.34.46-1.39.2-2.9-.81-3.91s-2.52-1.27-3.91-.81c-.66-1.31-1.91-2.19-3.34-2.19s-2.67.88-3.33 2.19c-1.4-.46-2.91-.2-3.92.81s-1.26 2.52-.8 3.91c-1.31.67-2.2 1.91-2.2 3.34s.89 2.67 2.2 3.34c-.46 1.39-.21 2.9.8 3.91s2.52 1.26 3.91.81c.67 1.31 1.91 2.19 3.34 2.19s2.68-.88 3.34-2.19c1.39.45 2.9.2 3.91-.81s1.27-2.52.81-3.91c1.31-.67 2.19-1.91 2.19-3.34zm-11.71 4.2L6.8 12.46l1.41-1.42 2.26 2.26 4.8-5.23 1.47 1.36-6.2 6.77z"></path></svg>
    بائع موثوق
</div><% } %>
              </div>
            </a>
            <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col text-center">
              <h3 class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-0.5 truncate"><%= p.name %></h3>
              <div class="text-sm font-extrabold text-brand-600 mb-2">$<%= p.price %></div>
              <a href="/phone/<%= p.id %>" class="w-full py-1.5 rounded-md font-bold text-[10px] text-white transition duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 <%= isAvailable ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-600 glow-green hover:from-green-600 hover:to-emerald-700' : (isSold ? 'bg-slate-800 cursor-not-allowed' : 'bg-slate-400 glow-gray cursor-not-allowed') %>">
                <% if (isAvailable) { %><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> متوفر<% } else if (isSold) { %><i class="fa-solid fa-ban"></i> تم البيع<% } else { %><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-xmark"></i> غير متوفر<% } %>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
      <% if (!isViewAll && !search && phones.length > 0 && totalPhonesCount > 12) { %><div class="flex justify-center mt-6 mb-2 w-full"><a href="/?view=all<%= activeBrand ? '&brand=' + encodeURIComponent(activeBrand) : '' %><%= currentSort ? '&sort=' + currentSort : '' %>" class="bg-slate-900 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-sm shadow-lg hover:bg-black hover:shadow-xl transition flex items-center gap-2">عرض جميع الأجهزة (<%= totalPhonesCount %> جهاز) <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></a></div><% } else if (isViewAll) { %><div class="flex justify-center mt-6 mb-2 w-full"><a href="/" class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-300 px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-sm shadow-sm hover:bg-slate-200 transition flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> العودة للصفحة الرئيسية</a></div><% } %>
    <% } %>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 py-4 w-full"><h2 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900 text-center mb-4">لماذا يثق بنا آلاف الزبائن؟</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2"><div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-certificate text-brand-600 text-lg mb-1"></i><h3 class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800">أجهزة أصلية 100%</h3><p class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-1">مستوردة بضمان الوكيل</p></div><div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-green-600 text-lg mb-1"></i><h3 class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800">ضمان سنة كاملة</h3><p class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-1">على جميع العيوب المصنعية</p></div><div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar text-amber-500 text-lg mb-1"></i><h3 class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800">افحص قبل الدفع</h3><p class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-1">داخل المحافظة</p></div><div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-center shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast text-purple-600 text-lg mb-1"></i><h3 class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-slate-800">شحن لكل المحافظات</h3><p class="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-1">مع فيديو فحص مسبق</p></div></div></div>
